00:51:47.680 --> 00:52:01.419
Steve McCown (Anonyome Labs, Inc.): Is in the past, when you get a driver's license, and you need to use that somewhere, like renting a car, in the old days, renting a video, staying in the hotel, doing all those kinds of things.

